Webhook security review — 2026-08-28
EFI: /api/webhooks/efi and /api/webhooks/efi/pix; URL HMAC, bounded JSON, provider verification.
PromissePay: /api/webhooks/promissepay; callback token, bounded JSON, provider verification, polling fallback.
Sharpify: /api/webhooks/sharpify; per-integration identifier, constant-time signature comparison, bounded JSON, provider verification.
All handlers return sanitized request IDs and do not log credentials or raw secrets.
Operational requirement: configure PromissePay callback in the provider dashboard.
Migration requirement: existing Sharpify admins save credentials once to create webhook_id.